ce":"புலம்புகொள்","parts":[{"text":"புலம்பு","lemma":"pulampu","gloss":"loneliness"},{"text":"கொள்","lemma":"koḷ","gloss":"to hold"}],"gloss":"bringing loneliness"},{"surface":"மாலையும்","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"mālai","gloss":"evening"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even the evening"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாரார்","parts":[{"text":"வாரார்","lemma":"வாரார்","gloss":"he has not returned"}],"gloss":"he has not returned","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"vāḻi","gloss":"may you live"}],"gloss":"may you live"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"வரூஉம்","parts":[{"text":"வரூஉம்","lemma":"வரூஉம்","gloss":"is coming"}],"gloss":"is coming","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்","parts":[{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"sweet"}],"gloss":"sweet"},{"surface":"உறழ்","parts":[{"text":"உறழ்","lemma":"uṟaḻ","gloss":"resembling"}],"gloss":"resembling"},{"surface":"இளமுலை","parts":[{"text":"இள","lemma":"iḷa","gloss":"young"},{"text":"முலை","lemma":"mulai","gloss":"breasts"}],"gloss":"young breasts"},{"surface":"ஞெமுங்க","parts":[{"text":"ஞெமுங்கு","lemma":"ñemuṅku","gloss":"to be pressed"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"a","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"to be pressed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னா","parts":[{"text":"இன்னா","lemma":"iṉṉā","gloss":"painful"}],"gloss":"painful"},{"surface":"வைப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"வைப்பு","lemma":"vaippu","gloss":"region"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the region"},{"surface":"சுரன்","parts":[{"text":"சுரன்","lemma":"curan","gloss":"desert path"}],"gloss":"desert path"},{"surface":"இறந்தோரே","parts":[{"text":"இறந்து","lemma":"iṟantu","gloss":"having traversed"},{"text":"ஓரே","lemma":"ōrē","gloss":"he indeed"}],"gloss":"he who traversed indeed"}]}],"literal":"Very high sky's water-filled fully pregnant / cool-sounding clouds, bright lightning flashing, / rain having poured down, darkening, even the evening bringing loneliness / has not returned, may you live, O friend, is coming, / sweet resembling young breasts to be pressed, / painful region's desert path traversed-he.","translation":"O friend, may you live! Even the evening, bringing loneliness, darkened by the pouring rain from the cool-sounding clouds fully pregnant with water in the very high sky where bright lightning flashes, is coming. But he has not returned—he who traversed the desert paths of that painful land—to embrace me so that my sweet, young breasts are pressed close.","modern":"தோழியே, நீ வாழ்க! மிக உயர்ந்த வானத்தில் நீரைக் கொண்டு நிறைசூலுற்ற குளிர்ந்த ஒலியையுடைய மேகங்கள் ஒளிரும் மின்னலை வீச, மழை பெய்து இருண்ட தனிமையைத் தரும் மாலைக் காலமும் வந்துவிட்டது. ஆனால், எனது இனிய இளமையான முலைகள் நெருங்கி அழுந்துமாறு என்னைத் தழுவுவதற்கு, துன்பம் தரும் இடங்களைக் கொண்ட பாலைநில வழியைக் கடந்து சென்ற நம் தலைவர் இன்னும் வரவில்லை.","explanation":"The speaker is the heroine talking to her friend during the onset of the rainy season, which belongs to the mullai tiṇai. Her husband had promised to return before the rains, but the rainy evening has arrived with dark clouds, lightning, and pouring rain, bringing intense loneliness. She laments that while the painful evening has come, her lover, who went traversing the harsh desert paths, has not yet returned to embrace her. The imagery of the water-laden, pregnant clouds and flashing lightning contrasts with her empty, unfulfilled desire for physical union. Key words like 'மாலையும் வரூஉம்' (even the evening is coming) and 'வாரார்' (he has not returned) highlight her despair and longing.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.08],[1.08,1.7],[1.7,2.3],[2.3,3.2],[3.2,3.3],[3.3,3.93],[4.0,4.33],[4.4,5.0],[5.42,6.0],[6.0,6.5],[6.5,7.1],[7.1,7.5],[7.5,7.68],[7.68,7.68],[7.68,8.6],[8.6,8.6],[8.6,8.6],[8.6,8.6],[8.6,9.6],[9.6,11.9],[11.9,12.3],[12.3,12.6]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.4],[1.55,2.1],[2.1,2.7],[2.7,3